'''Mantellian Savrips''' were a [[Sentience|sentient]], but technologically primitive, [[Reptile|reptilian]] [[species]] from the [[planet]] [[Ord Mantell]] whose appearance was used for one of the [[Hologram|holographic]] pieces in the game [[dejarik]].<ref name="BMF 48" /> Large in size,<ref name="SW10">[[Star Wars (2015) 10|''Star Wars'' (2015) 10]]</ref> they had [[Color|gray]] skin and horned heads with red [[eye]]s, attached to their upper torsos by long necks partially covered in strands of orange [[hair]].<ref name="The Force Awakens" /> Mantellian Savrips had a pair of long, powerful [[Limb|arms]] that terminated in claw-tipped, four-fingered hands and two short legs with three-toed feet.<ref name="Always Two There Are">{{Rebels|Always Two There Are}}</ref> Earning fame, [[Kalhar]] was a Mantellian Savrip who found work as a [[gladiator]] and brawler.<ref name="BMF 48">{{BuildFalconCite|48|Guide to the Galaxy}}</ref>

